> Dogs and cats gain 1 HP for every kill. Once in a while, that means they
> also gain a level. When they reach a certain maximum level, they stop
> gaining HP by fighting. Then, they will only raise in level by you feeding
> them wraith corpses, or by polymorphing into a creature that can reach a
> higher level.
> 
> I noticed my djinni pet gained multiple HP per kill. I'm not sure how
> exactly it works.

_Any_ monster (tame or not, domestic or not), can gain multiple max HP
per kill; it's a roll of a die with (ML+1) sides, where ML is the
victim's level. Tougher monsters can generally kill tougher monsters,
is all.

(Also, the gain is capped at the amount needed for the next level
increase, and capped absolutely if such is no longer permitted.)

